  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for podofo",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for podofo fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2018-8002: infinite loop vulnerability in ParseFileComplete() (bsc#1084891).\n- CVE-2020-18971: stack-based buffer overflow in src/base/PdfDictionary.cpp (bsc#1190178).\n- CVE-2021-30470: uncontrolled recursive call of funtions in src/base/PdfTokenizer.cpp can lead to a stack overflow\n  (bsc#1186588).\n- CVE-2021-30471: uncontrolled recursive call in PdfNamesTree:AddToDictionary function in\n  src/podofo/doc/PdfNamesTree.cpp (bsc#1184645).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
